{"version":1,"content":"<p>據知情人士透露，已辭去英偉達行政總裁職務的黃仁勳此前曾向公司多名高管描述其與中國商界人士Alice Huang之間的關係為正常商業往來，但內部調查過程中披露的信息顯示，雙方實際上存在婚外情關係。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586358.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.977021+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:43:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"491fc3f9123fcbefb2cd116d40b5beecd110a6aa2f558cac75238a591e6319d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}